flowchart TD
  S([Start]) --> Q{Login or Register?}
  Q -->|Register| RG[Validate and create user] --> Q
  Q -->|Login| LG{Credentials valid?}
  LG -->|No| Q
  LG -->|Yes| MN[User menu]
  MN --> OP[Add / View / Edit / Delete / Filter / Report / Export]
  OP --> VA{Input valid?}
  VA -->|No| ER[Show error] --> MN
  VA -->|Yes| DB[(Update or read DB)] --> MN
  MN -->|Logout| Q
  Q -->|Exit| EN([End])
